## Ongoing Services:
Should you choose to proceed with our recommendations, we will provide you with our Ongoing advice and review s ervice, as described in the ' Important Information about our Services ' document we have supplied to you , until either you , or we , consider this service to be no longer appropriate for your needs.
## Fees
The fees you are required to pay for our advisory services are set out in the suitability report and any subsequent charges confirmation. You will need to provide confirmation of your acceptance by approving them expressly or by written consent.
